\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces The inversion. (a) On the security task over identical PROMISE\_exp{} items, both encoders start well above the range spanned by the eight prompted models and fall through it as distribution shift increases. (b) The same reversal in the paired tests: 260 exact McNemar comparisons, split by the regime the encoder was evaluated under.}}{5}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
